S3Sink/archive records the archive at s3://acme-audit/kuberecord, region eu-west-1.

An object store has no address that resolves only inside a cluster, so all of it
transfers unchanged.

Its endpoint http://minio.kuberecord-system.svc:9000 resolves inside the cluster too.

It is recorded as it stands: an endpoint carries a scheme and a certificate name as
well as a host, so substituting a forwarded port for it is not a guess this command
will make. Edit s3.endpoint in the configuration file if you read it from outside.

Credentials are not in this file and never will be: the AWS chain resolves them —
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID and friends, ~/.aws/config, SSO, an instance role.
